  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.<br>• Cut cauliflower into small florets. <br>• Cut sweet potato into small chunks. <br>• Cut red onion into thick wedges.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e0f470f8f6928425d5c05d/step-a009b900.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. <br>Drizzle with some oil from the marinated goat <br>cheese (save the rest of the oil for the dressing!).<br>• Sprinkle with chermoula spice blend and <br>season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat.<br>• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.<br>TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies <br>between two trays.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e0f470f8f6928425d5c05d/step-38ea4b10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While the veggies are roasting, heat a <br>drizzle of olive oil in a large saucepan over <br>medium-high heat.<br>• Toast pearl couscous, stirring occasionally, until <br>golden, 1-2 minutes.<br>• Carefully half-fill the saucepan with water, then <br>add a pinch of salt. Simmer, uncovered, until <br>tender, 14-16 minutes.<br>• Drain, rinse and return to the pan. <br>• Add vegetable stock powder and a drizzle of <br>olive oil. Stir to combine. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e0f470f8f6928425d5c05d/step-5233d420.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large bowl, combine some oil from the <br>goat cheese (1 tbs for 2 people / 2 tbs for <br>4 people) with the vinegar and honey. Season <br>to taste with salt and pepper. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e0f470f8f6928425d5c05d/step-16a14730.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• To the bowl with the dressing, add <br>spinach &amp; rocket mix, pearl couscous and <br>roasted veggies. Gently toss to combine. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e0f470f8f6928425d5c05d/step-5e694840.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide the spiced cauliflower salad <br>between plates.<br>• Crumble goat cheese over the salad. <br>• Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e0f470f8f6928425d5c05d/step-cc85e450.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
